WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.875
You begin with identity, because
everything else decides on it.

2
00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:07.195
Access policy, devices,
data, certificates:

3
00:00:07.195 --> 00:00:10.800
each one asks who or what
is making the request.

4
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.529
If the answer to that
question isn't trustworthy,

5
00:00:13.529 --> 00:00:15.712
nothing built on top of it can be either.

6
00:00:15.712 --> 00:00:20.257
That's why the workbook numbers its
books in this order, with identity first

7
00:00:20.257 --> 00:00:24.875
and infrastructure next, then the cloud
boundary, assurance and operations.

8
00:00:24.875 --> 00:00:27.250
Skipping ahead only moves the problem.

9
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:31.340
And right now there's an unusual
opportunity on the identity side.
